    "body": "<header>\n<h1 data-aid=\"128477761\" id=\"title1\"><strong>Jesus Christ, Spirit of</strong></h1>\n</header>\n<div class=\"body-block\">\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul class=\"reference\">\n<li>\n<p class=\"title\" data-aid=\"128477762\" id=\"title2\"><em>See also</em> <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/tg/god-spirit-of?lang=eng\">God, Spirit of</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/tg/holy-spirit?lang=eng\">Holy Spirit</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/tg/light-of-christ?lang=eng\">Light of Christ</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/tg/lord-spirit-of?lang=eng\">Lord, Spirit of</a></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477763\" id=\"p1\">salvation through … the supply of the <span class=\"key-word\">Spirit</span> of Jesus, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/philip/1?lang=eng&amp;id=p19#p19\">Philip. 1:19</a>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477765\" id=\"p2\"><span class=\"key-word\">Spirit</span> of Christ is given to every man, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/moro/7?lang=eng&amp;id=p16#p16\">Moro. 7:16</a>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n</div>",
